@startuml
title Weather Data Collection – Simplified API Flow

actor User
participant Script
participant "airport_coordinates.csv" as AC
participant "historical_flights.csv" as HF
participant "Open-Meteo API" as API
participant "weather_chunks/*.csv" as CH
participant "weather_data.csv" as FINAL

User -> Script: Run script
Script -> AC: Load airport coordinates
Script -> HF: Load historical flights
Script -> Script: Build flight_times_unique\n(group by airport, hourly)

loop For each airport
  Script -> API: GET /v1/archive (lat, lon,\nstart_date, end_date, hourly vars)
  API --> Script: JSON hourly weather data
  Script -> Script: Filter to needed hours
  Script -> CH: Save weather_chunk_###.csv
end

Script -> CH: Read chunk files
CH --> Script: DataFrames
Script -> FINAL: Append to weather_data.csv
FINAL --> Script: Acknowledgement

Script -> User: Report summary\n(records, airports, date range)

@enduml
